    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok thanks. one more thing—we've had some issues with stuff getting contaminated or smelling off even when we follow the temps. can you explain the actual biology of how these bacteria like C. perfringens actually multiply in the food? i want to understand the mechanism so i can explain the risk to my staff better.",
